OW: Survival Protocol&quot; fuses side-scrolling platformer action with survivor-style combat. In a future city ruled by an AI legion, you are the last ghost soldier. Dodge, jump, and carve your path through endless swarms of enemies to survive.","steam_appid":4048930,"support_info":{"email":"ironshadow.survival@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Korean","type":"game","website":null}